{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13621","headline":"酬诸公宿镜水宅 · 严维","name":"酬诸公宿镜水宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸免低头向府中，贵将藜藿与君同。\n阳雁呌霜来枕上，寒山映月在湖中。\n诗书何德名夫子，草木推年长数公。\n闻道汉家偏尚少，此身那此访芝翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}